<span class="chips"><span class="chip meal">Dinner</span><span class="chip drive">→ 25 min</span><span class="chip">unhurried</span></span><span class="flow">1 hr 10 porch dinner · <em>35 min drive → Grant</em></span></span></summary>
<div class="body"><p>1891 colonnade, sunroom, sometimes a string quartet. Dinner, not a stop.</p><p><b>Beta:</b> Park in the angle spots out front. The formal dining room takes reservations (307-344-7311 same-day sometimes works) but the sunroom bar seats walk-ins with the same lake view — order there, zero planning required. The porch rockers out front are free to anyone; claim two for the pre-dinner sit.</p><a class="maplink" href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Lake+Yellowstone+Hotel">⌖ Open in Maps</a></div></details></div>

