<div class="body"><p>Highest bridge in Wyoming, over a slot gorge that makes everyone lean over the rail. New for you too — Friday skipped it on purpose.</p><p><b>Beta:</b> Small parking pull-off on the west side just past the bridge — walk back ACROSS the bridge on the walkway and look straight down into the slot. 300 feet of gorge under your feet. Two minutes, permanent memory.</p><a class="maplink" href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Sunlight+Creek+Bridge+WY">⌖ Open in Maps</a></div></details></div>

